ed\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>This new dwarf cave was implemented in the Summer Update 2008, and has its location on the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33347,32031,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33347, 32031, 7)</a>, south/south-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>. Some Dwarven Raiders have camped themselves there after fleeing from the stressful life of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, in the hope of starting a new population on the humble island of Cormaya.\nThis is a fairly great place for mid-levels to level, because of its unknown state and easy environment. This is also a great place to make a lootbag if you are short on cash. Be sure to take with you a parcel, or you'll end up dragging it through Edron Rotworm Cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters in -1 Floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\"><img alt=\"Dwarf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarf_8e3a63.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">31 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" lo